{
  "name": "西夏文自动标注工具",
  "short_name": "西夏文标注",
  "description": "A tool for studying Tangut. Supports 4 input methods(strokes,LFW codes,Four-Corner codes,Unicode), provides phonetic, grammatical, bilingual semantic annotations. 此工具是一款在线西夏文字研究工具，支持笔画、LFW序号、四角号码和Unicode输入，并提供语音、语法标注及中英双语语义输出。",
